:: Setup [startup]
{(set:$keys to 0)
(set:$code to "")}


:: Start
A door, and a key on the floor.
(if:$keys is 0)[ [[Take the key|Key]] ]
[[Leave|Door]]


:: Key
(set:$keys to 1)The key is cold.
(link:"Pick it up")[(set:$code to "KEY")(goto:"Door")]
(link:"Put it back")[(set:$keys to 0)(goto:"Start")]


:: Door
(if:$keys > 0)[The door opens.](else:)[(set:$code to "LOST")The door stays shut.]
